            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Messor falce frūmentum metit. The reaper cuts the grain with a sickle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Third declension, feminine: falx, falcis f. A curved blade for grain or for pruning vines."
            }
