              "text": "trīticum, trīticī — \"wheat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Agricola trīticum in agrō serit. The farmer sows wheat in the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: trīticum, trīticī n. The best grain for bread."
            }
          ]
        },
